type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n[]\n```","ts":"1633083120.286900","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"bb6361cb-fcdd-495a-9c6d-871f0f58cae1","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":":echo getmatches()","ts":"1633083118.286800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2RwJV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c48fb6f9-07a1-4ca5-ac6c-2b78292b263b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"確かに","ts":"1633080358.286300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0+Af"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e41f2172-c7fc-47f3-b439-505dc9eeaf03","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"`\\` が置換されちゃうからそもそも `escape(x, '\\')` が不適切ですね。","ts":"1633076221.286100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fb+TM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b72f84fe-0c55-4b8a-84a4-76a5d0960dad","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"特殊文字を `[]` で囲むのは以前試したけど何かでうまく行かないパターンがあったんだったような…単にスケープ対象が足りなかっただけかな…忘れてしまった…","ts":"1633063963.285000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"21A5B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6088366c-386d-44a3-9a40-82138124005d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`/` とか `\\` の変換はあった方がよさそうな気もする…ふーむ","ts":"1633063907.284200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zp1S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45deca00-e6a7-498d-95d0-af6b466ac6fa","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"えーつまり上記の `bufnr('^\\V' . escape(name, '\\'), '\\$')` だとまずい?","ts":"1633063852.284000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"osLNE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d797160-5ba2-45c7-bd2e-ac0fb6f57777","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"力技感…どちらにしてもか…","ts":"1633063788.283400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bb7Y7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8e2222a-9402-4252-8046-dddc59d1c46c","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"まぁ、いまだったらgetbufinfo()があるから\n```function! s:strict_bufnr(name) abort\n\tfor x in getbufinfo()\n\t\tif bufname(x.bufnr) == a:name\n\t\t\treturn x.bufnr\n\t\tendif\n\tendfor\n\treturn -1\nendfunction```\nでいける","ts":"1633032552.282900","edited":{"user":"UBQ2H65JQ","ts":"1633032661.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"39Ry"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b94d8886-fb89-4244-aa6a-47e77876627d","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"`\\` は `[\\/]`に変換されちゃうから、\n`[v]` のバッファに完全一致させたければ\n`bufnr('^[[]v[]]$')` だな。 `[` や `]` はエスケーブされないので","ts":"1633031649.282300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MKnD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f186bb93-c683-4e53-8ed2-8704eb6b7b8d","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"ファイルパターンを正規表現に変換しているから、\n`*` -\u0026gt; `.*`\n`.` -\u0026gt; `\\.`\n`~` -\u0026gt; `\\~`\n`?` -\u0026gt; `.`\n`\\` -\u0026gt; `[\\/]`\n`/` -\u0026gt; `[\\/]`\nなどをしているんだなぁ","ts":"1633031156.280300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dPJaj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"184301f7-43f0-4ecf-be4c-13bff514d62d","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"あダメだ。パターンをfile_pat_to_reg_pat関数でエスケープしている","ts":"1633030187.278600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UKD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60fa4f80-ffa3-4593-93c4-c4ab6fe23db9","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"ここの処理の前で\nIgnore 'magic' and 'cpoptions'する処理をしているのでちょっと気を付ける必要があるけど、特にset nomagicしている人は","ts":"1633029924.277800","edited":{"user":"UBQ2H65JQ","ts":"1633030042.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BU67"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53ea1be8-6c00-40e7-a3f8-ff06714739e8","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"なのでほぼほぼ\n`bufnr('^\\V' . escape(name, '\\'), '\\$')`\nでいけますね。","ts":"1633029795.276700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Opq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69225191-6e89-43c1-a8a9-a666ce3b1085","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"buffer.cのbuflist_findpat関数内にて","ts":"1633029549.275300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L=XI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00e8784d-d7e2-418b-be60-b417c2e05981","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"このあと\n```for (attempt = 0; attempt \u0026lt;= 3; ++attempt)```\nでループしてます","ts":"1633029503.275000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TD+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"657d74db-f322-4920-a7d7-1a72c7b6dce7","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"bufnr()の実装を追ってみたら\n```     * Try four ways of matching a listed buffer:\n     * attempt == 0: without '^' or '$' (at any position)\n     * attempt == 1: with '^' at start (only at position 0)\n     * attempt == 2: with '$' at end (only match at end)\n     * attempt == 3: with '^' at start and '$' at end (only full match)\n     * Repeat this for finding an unlisted buffer if there was no matching\n     * listed buffer.```\nというコメントと処理があった。","ts":"1633029473.274600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yZ="}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n  2 %a   \"foo.txt\"                      line 1\n```","ts":"1633027621.273600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"f55f73da-740c-447f-88f5-b38f2a2703d7","type":"message","user